				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
					<li><strong>Total Net Worth:</strong> Includes all assets—primary residence home equity, vehicles, physical property, business equity, plus savings and stock investments minus all debt.</li>
					<li><strong>Liquid Net Worth:</strong> Excludes illiquid assets like primary real estate and physical property, focusing strictly on cash, High-Yield Savings Accounts (HYSA), brokerage stock accounts, and accessible retirement assets.</li>
